yn University in Ifrane Opening hours Opening hours are not currently displayed for this library. Update opening hours Member login is required to update opening hours. Key statistics Measure Value Unit Collection size 98,000 volumes Technology profile Library system and discovery Service Product Year recorded Current automation system Medad ILS 2024 Previous automation system Sierra 2019 Previous automation system Millennium 2004 Previous automation system Locally developed 2001 Discovery index EBSCO Discovery Service 2013 Discovery interface EBSCO Discovery Service 2013 Authentication service OpenAthens 2024 Digital and research services Service Product Year recorded Digital collection management Medad DAR 2024 Institutional repository DSpace Archives management Omeka Web and engagement Service Product Year recorded Web content management Medad Portal 2024 Equipment and operations Service Product Year recorded Item ID type RFID System arrangements This library is responsible for procuring its automation system. 2026 Library Automation Perceptions Survey Share your library's experience with its automation and discovery systems. Your response contributes to research that helps libraries evaluate these products and services. We invite the person most familiar with this library's automation and discovery systems to complete the 2026 Library Automation Perceptions Survey. This library is currently listed as using Medad ILS . Standard identifiers libraries.org ID 2093 OCLC symbol ALAUL WorldCat Registry ID 39603 Related libraries Libraries affiliated with Al Akhawayn University in Ifrane Libraries in Ifrane, Morocco Academic libraries in Morocco Member Services Member login is required to use these services. Log in or register for a free account . Edit this record Add to portfolio Update opening hours About this record This listing is part of libraries.org , the library directory maintained by Library Technology Guides . Permanent URL https://librarytechnology.org/library/2093 Record created Nov 30, 1997 Last updated Oct 28, 2026 Appropriate use of this information This listing is provided for research and reference. Details may have changed since the record was last updated, so please verify operational information directly with the library. Automated harvesting, bulk downloading, and systematic extraction of directory data require prior permission. See the Terms of Service for information about data use and authorized access. Maintained by Marshall Breeding Copyright 1999-2026",
